<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>लोधा समाज इंदौर — reel end card</title>
  <!--
    The last shot of the introduction reel. It is a page rather than something
    drawn in ffmpeg so that it uses the site's own fonts, colours and logo - the
    card a viewer sees last should look like the place it is sending them to.

    It needs the site's /assets/ to resolve, so it has to be served from the
    site root - but it is NOT a page of the site, and a published page there
    would be served by Pages, indexed, and (rightly) failed by the head-tag
    guard in tools/test_set_domain.py. So this file is a template, not HTML:
    reel-intro-capture.mjs copies it to .reel-endcard.html at the root, shoots
    it, and removes it. The leading dot is what keeps it out - both
    set_domain.is_site_file and check_links skip dot-paths, and so does Pages.
  -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css">
  <style>
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 70% at 50% 0%, rgba(232, 163, 61, 0.22), transparent 62%),
        var(--ind-d);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .card { padding: 0 44px; }
    .card img { width: 128px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .card h1 {
      margin: 0; font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 2.6rem; line-height: 1.2; color: #fff;
    }
    .tag {
      margin: 10px 0 34px; color: var(--mar);
      font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    .url {
      display: inline-block; padding: 14px 26px;
      border: 2px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: var(--body); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em; color: #fff;
    }
    .phone { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #e6dff5; }
    .phone b { display: block; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
    .jai { margin-top: 44px; font-family: var(--head); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--gold); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="">
    <h1>लोधा समाज इंदौर</h1>
    <p class="tag">सेवा · शिक्षा · स्वास्थ्य</p>
    <p class="url">lodhasamaj.org</p>
    <p class="phone">फ़ोन एवं व्हाट्सऐप<b>+91 90987 81740</b></p>
    <p class="jai">॥ जय माता दी ॥</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
